OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Labour leader says the UK
OL,4,Ashould re-join EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Labour leader has called
OL,7,Ffor the UK to re-join the European
OL,8,FUnion, insisting it should be a
OL,9,F"long-term objective" for the whole
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FDuring his first major speech since
OL,13,Fbecoming party leader, Michael Marra
OL,14,Fsaid he wanted "solidarity, not
OL,15,Fseparation" and accepted that
OL,16,F"re-joining the EU won't be easy".
OL,18,FMarra acknowledged there would be
OL,19,F"serious questions" over issues such as
OL,20,Fcurrency and borders before the UK
OL,21,Fcould return to the EU.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
