OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Labour leader says the UK
OL,4,Ashould re-join EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, the UK government ruled out
OL,7,Fre-joining the EU within this
OL,8,Fparliament but Prime Minister Andy
OL,9,FBurnham said he wanted to explore
OL,10,Fcloser ties with Europe.
